Hi all,

£37.4k vs £37.3k, so on budget, 256 in / 28 trans.

Something new today: from around 1pm we had a steady stream of young Korean tourists, almost all asking for one thing - the Aurea in BLACK, mostly in size 1. Five asked for a 1 and two for a 2. We have sold the last black 1 and 2 earlier in the week so I could only offer beige and navy, which nobody wanted. One girl showed me a screenshot from a Korean drama with the actress wearing it.

Is this happening at Bond Street too? Could planning check if there's any black Aurea anywhere?

Also missed: Aria pink 00, jersey polo navy XL.

